  "summary": "Complex geometric patterns created from overlapping regular polygons and star polygons with strapwork lines.",
  "description": "Girih patterns feature intricate interlaced lines forming complex star and polygon shapes, emerging from Islamic mathematical traditions. These designs developed alongside Islamic architectural ornamentation, serving both decorative and symbolic purposes in religious spaces.",
